  "success_criteria_spot_check": {
    "note": "The 7 pages named in the AQ-02A brief were opened directly and read end-to-end; all show narrative (About This Entry / Beginner Guide where authored / Wine Pairing Explanation with rationale / Common Culinary Uses / FAQ where authored / Knowledge Cards) before any reference table.",
